# Landing quality. Three drops onto the flat, travelling north at 5 m/s:
#  1. board 8 degrees off, 0.9 m drop: clean, the board lines up, the speed is kept;
#  2. board 32 degrees off, same drop: sketchy, the board turns half way, the wheels scrub the rest;
#  3. board straight, 9.2 m drop (13.2 m/s into the ground, over land.stumbleSpeed 13, under land.hardSpeed 14): stumble, speed x 0.6.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -20 -12 1.0 8
cmd 1 set skater.vel.y 5
cmd 150 teleport -10 -12 1.0 32
cmd 151 set skater.vel.y 5
cmd 300 teleport 0 -12 9.3 0
cmd 301 set skater.vel.y 5
run 560
expect event land{quality=clean} within 40..60
expect skater.speed > 4.85 at 80
expect event land{quality=sketchy} within 190..210
expect skater.speed < 4.85 at 230
expect skater.speed > 4.4 at 230
expect event land{quality=stumble} within 463..467
expect skater.speed < 3.2 at 480
expect no event bail
